    "overview": "The Ant Esports Crystal Neo Mini is designed to deliver excellent airflow, reliable performance, and compatibility with modern PC builds. Featuring support for Micro-ATX and Mini-ITX motherboards, 5 pre-installed ARGB fans, and support for graphics cards up to 415mm long, it ensures efficient cooling and flexible hardware compatibility. With support for CPU air coolers up to 180mm and 360mm AIO liquid cooling on the top, it is ideal for gaming, content creation, and everyday computing. The cabinet also includes a metal frame, tempered glass, cable management support, USB Type-C connectivity, and support for up to 1 HDD and 2 SSDs. Whether you are building a new gaming PC or upgrading your existing setup, this cabinet offers stylish design, dependable performance, and essential functionality for PC enthusiasts.",
